<title>USA: Grubb &amp; Ellis Co Q2 Dec 31 oper net off.</title>
<headline>Grubb &amp; Ellis Co Q2 Dec 31 oper net off.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.35		   $ 0.42</p>
<p> Oper net		   5,147		    5,332</p>
<p> Revs			68,034		   60,381</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,335		    8,828</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest Q2 results exclude gain of $3.6 million or $0.27/shr on early extinguishment of debt.  </p>
<p>6 MONTHS  Oper shr		   $0.43		    $0.42</p>
<p> Oper net		   6,443		    5,928</p>
<p> Revs		     119,961		  107,743</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,669		    8,850</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest six-month results exclude gain of $3.6 million or $0.28/shr from early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>The company also said its FY97 Q2 oper results include a net charge of $1 million related to the planned relocation of its corporate headquarters to Northbrook, Ill. from San Francisco. FY96 Q2 included a net charge of $234,000 to Special Charges and Unusual Items.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
